 2
Write a PL/SQL program that prompts for a number and displays
whether it is ODD or EVEN.
(Control Structures)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------

sql> ACCEPT P_NUM PROMPT 'Enter a Number : '

sql> DECLARE
       N NUMBER:=&P_NUM;
     BEGIN

       IF MOD(N,2)=0 THEN
          DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('EVEN NUMBER');
       ELSE
          DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('ODD NUMBER');
       END IF;

     END;
     /

Output:
-------

Enter a Number : 25

ODD NUMBER

PL/SQL procedure successfully completed.


Another Output:
---------------

Enter a Number : 100

EVEN NUMBER

PL/SQL procedure successfully completed.


